      "comments": [
        {
          "datatype": null,
          "language": "en",
          "lexical": "Once the delivery is pumped into the tank, the two portions are in contact and hence one maximally self-connected portion of gasoline -- a new quantity. Neither input is a sub-quantity of it: they are of the same kind as the whole, and after mixing neither is a maximally self-connected portion any more. Nor did :DepotSupplyBeforeTuesday simply grow: quantities are extensional, so a change of parts is a change of whole, and their parts are essential. What links them is history, not parthood."
        }
      ],
